<meta preferred-color-scheme="dark" />
<style>
  .card { width: 40; height: 36; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2; padding: 2; background-color: rgba(6, 16, 26, 0.9); border-color: #2fc8ff; border-width: 0.25; border-radius: 1.6; }
  .title { font-size: 2.6; font-weight: 700; color: #ffb04a; }
  .h { font-size: 2; font-weight: 700; color: #7fd8ff; }
  .t { font-size: 1.8; color: #c9d7e0; }
</style>
<Panel width="40" height="36">
  <div class="card">
    <span class="title">HELP STATION</span>
    <span class="h">HANDS</span>
    <span class="t">Pinch: select / pick up small parts</span>
    <span class="t">Grab: hold guns and big parts</span>
    <span class="t">Release a part at its glowing slot to snap</span>
    <span class="h">CONTROLLERS</span>
    <span class="t">Trigger: select    Grip: hold</span>
    <span class="t">Left X menu | Left Y wheel</span>
    <span class="t">Right A hint | Right B remove part</span>
    <span class="h">DESKTOP</span>
    <span class="t">Click to select, hold to carry, wheel = distance</span>
    <span class="t">M menu | B wheel | H hint | T remove | 1-5 guns</span>
  </div>
</Panel>
